  "contentHtml": "<p>학교에 천정형 전원공급장치가 없어서 멀티탭을 이용하여 전선을 깔아야 해서 전원 장치를 이용한 실험이 어려운 상황입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>혹시 첨부한 실험들이 전원장치가 아닌 건전지로 가능한 실험일까요?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 전압과 전류 사이의 관계</p><p>2. 전류가 흐르는 코일 주위의 자기장</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb39cdfed0016fd1e5890803e48c72310771e228\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb39cdfed0016fd1e5890803e48c72310771e228\" data-origin-width=\"915\" data-origin-height=\"786\"><div class=\"figcaption\">1</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3f67d3866a68f6e6a3ebddb476af19d312420d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3f67d3866a68f6e6a3ebddb476af19d312420d9\" data-origin-width=\"895\" data-origin-height=\"361\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1de0c0d715233e0733835c3efbf70b850f25e584\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1de0c0d715233e0733835c3efbf70b850f25e584\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"737\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
